-- cape-town-appliances-montague-gardens (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Cape Town Appliances sells scratch and dent appliances from leading brands at its outlet store in Montague Gardens. Stock includes fridges and freezers, ovens, stoves, microwaves, hobs, laundry appliances and dishwashers, and the business also offers on-site and off-site repairs to all appliances.

Discounts range from 15% to 40% below normal retail pricing, and each appliance carries a one-year guarantee. Because stock depends on what suppliers deliver, items are sold first come, first served and must be viewed in store, so customers are advised to call ahead to check availability. An optional paid delivery service is available through an independent contractor.

